---
import Social from "../components/Social.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About · ceifa"
  description="Gabriel Francisco, ceifa on the internet. Software developer from Belo Horizonte, Brazil."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <h1><span data-land="text" id="first-perch">Hi, I'm Gabriel.</span></h1>
  </section>
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      <span data-land="text"
        >I'm a software developer from Belo Horizonte, Brazil. On the internet I go by ceifa.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p>
      <span data-land="text"
        >Garry's Mod taught me a lot of what I know. I've been part of its community since 2014 and
        have run servers since 2015, writing plenty of Lua along the way. Games are still behind a
        lot of my open source: putting Lua where it was never meant to run, getting Steam into
        Electron games, small tools for game servers.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p>
      <span data-land="text"
        >Lately I've been building around AI agents. Eleven lets my local agent answer me on Discord
        and Telegram, and agenthost gives agents a place to publish what they make.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p>
      <span data-land="text">I write here every now and then, mostly about programming.</span>
    </p>
    <Social class="social about-links" data-land="top" discord />
  </div>
</Layout>
